            "review_text": "Adrian B\n24 contributions\n0\nSmall quantity and no explaination\nApr 2017 • Couples\nThe fisrt time we tried korean food. The staff appeared friendly but was not speaking english.\nThey did not explained us how to eat the dish (we understood you have to put the meat and garlics in salad leaf at the end).\nHalf the dishes for bbq on the menu were unavailable but they only told us when we ordered. \nWhen we saw the dish with bbq pork we were disapointed: they were verry little meat, but a lot off garlics with different seasoning. We quit still hungry with a bill off 350k, it is quite expansive here.\nSo if you like salad, this is the place for you.\nWritten April 15, 2017",
